\section{Discussion}
\label{sec:disc}

Our experiments evaluate these results on a 50M-scale PoC.
Saturation remained stable under the tested configuration,
growth remained within the configured capacity, incorporation
satisfied the tested integrity constraints, forgetting remained
below the observed threshold, and plexus weights converged in
the tested setting.

